{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Dragonbone City" Styxia|Styxia, the City-State of Dragons and Waves... At present, the River of Souls has encircled this pitiful city.<br />The Philosopher's Stone provided by Anaxagoras and the art of alchemy can summon the Titan lurking with the River of Souls, and the alchemical materials should be found in the city as well.}}
