:'''Castorice:''' ...
:'''Castorice:''' Apologies, I don't have much in the way of savings, but perhaps there's another way for me to release you from your suffering.
:'''Castorice:''' Please relax. May you fall asleep peacefully... amid a gentle field of flowers.
